    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scratchin' Melodii is a rhythm game about self expression.</strong> With gameplay inspired by the classic call-and-response roots of the rhythm game genre, your rival plays a beat, and you respond to it with your own! All in stylish fully animated songs that YOU control! (well, in your parts of it at least!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/bf8524141588a48c01e3686aab5648cb.poster.avif?t=1746416003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/bf8524141588a48c01e3686aab5648cb.webm?t=1746416003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/bf8524141588a48c01e3686aab5648cb.mp4?t=1746416003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melodii is a genderless young DJ who's gotten in trouble with the government for doing graffiti. Now owing community service, join Melodii on a ridiculous Funk &amp; Hip-Hop adventure where they'll make friends, enemies, and some sick freestyles. Do you have what it takes to be off the chart?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying rhythm gameplay with cool freestyle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funky original songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn 2D animations for each song</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loveable (okay some of them are kinda hateable) characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG-inspired story mode to tie it all together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/2f208ed7d0e7e05f8b196746c7965e2c.poster.avif?t=1746416003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/2f208ed7d0e7e05f8b196746c7965e2c.webm?t=1746416003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/2f208ed7d0e7e05f8b196746c7965e2c.mp4?t=1746416003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scratchin' Melodii is a rhythm game about self expression.</strong> With gameplay inspired by the classic call-and-response roots of the rhythm game genre, your rival plays a beat, and you respond to it with your own! All in stylish fully animated songs that YOU control! (well, in your parts of it at least!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/bf8524141588a48c01e3686aab5648cb.poster.avif?t=1746416003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/bf8524141588a48c01e3686aab5648cb.webm?t=1746416003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/bf8524141588a48c01e3686aab5648cb.mp4?t=1746416003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melodii is a genderless young DJ who's gotten in trouble with the government for doing graffiti. Now owing community service, join Melodii on a ridiculous Funk &amp; Hip-Hop adventure where they'll make friends, enemies, and some sick freestyles. Do you have what it takes to be off the chart?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying rhythm gameplay with cool freestyle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funky original songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn 2D animations for each song</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loveable (okay some of them are kinda hateable) characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG-inspired story mode to tie it all together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/2f208ed7d0e7e05f8b196746c7965e2c.poster.avif?t=1746416003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/2f208ed7d0e7e05f8b196746c7965e2c.webm?t=1746416003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2728050/extras/2f208ed7d0e7e05f8b196746c7965e2c.mp4?t=1746416003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
